  "question": {
    "text": "A cylinder of radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> is surrounded by a cylindrical shell of inner radius <math><mi>R</mi></math> and outer radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math>. The thermal conductivity of the material of the inner cylinder is <math><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and that of the outer cylinder is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.&nbsp;Assuming no loss of heat, the effective thermal conductivity of the system for heat flowing along the&nbsp;length of the cylinder is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Po03l",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3Axl1",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "07022",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "sx6w4",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
